# Copy to `.env.local` for local development; Vite loads it automatically.
#
# Endpoint returning ICE servers, including a TURN relay. Two shapes are
# accepted (see src/net/iceservers.ts):
#   - a bare array          — what Metered and most managed providers return
#   - { "iceServers": [] }  — what turn/auth/ returns
#
# Unset is a supported state: the app falls back to STUN only, which is fine
# for local and same-network peers and fails for most phones on cellular.
#
# NOT A SECRET. Whatever is in this URL ships in the client bundle and is
# readable by anyone who loads the page. With a managed provider that means the
# API key is public and someone else can spend your quota — rotate it freely,
# and self-host (see turn/) when that matters.
VITE_TURN_CREDENTIALS_URL=
